In `com.networknt.handler.HandlerTest`, the unit test `validConfig_init_handlersCreated()` can trigger `java.lang.RuntimeException` when being run before the unit test `invalidMethod_init_throws()` in the same class because it pollutes state shared among tests.\r\n- It may be good to clean this state pollution so that some other tests do not fail in the future due to the shared state polluted by this test.\r\n\r\nFixes #2005 \r\n\r\n#### Solution\r\n- Resetting the `HandlerConfig` to default value before each test run using the Junit's `@Before` annotation, where the configuration is set to default value through `Handler.setConfig('handler')`\r\n- Adding `initChain()` because `initPath()`  in `setConfig`, which expects handler or chain to already be created.", "labels": [], "milestone": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "created_at": "2023-11-14T03:38:23Z", "updated_at": "2024-10-01T19:24:35Z", "closed_at": "2023-11-19T16:12:17Z", "merged_at": "2023-11-19T16:12:17Z", "merge_commit_sha": "fc11652ab8eea2b4de2acf6e33479bc0af223369", "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "head": {"label": "saaivenk:fix-order-dependent-test-in-handler-test", "ref": "fix-order-dependent-test-in-handler-test", "repo": {"id": 717611920, "node_id": "R_kgDOKsXjkA", "name": "light-4j", "full_name": "saaivenk/light-4j", "owner": {"login": "saaivenk", "id": 46614118, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjE0MTE4", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46614118?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/saaivenk", "html_url": "https://github.com/saaivenk", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/saaivenk/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/saaivenk/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/saaivenk/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/saaivenk/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/saaivenk/subscriptions", "org